WEBVTT

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:48.310
I heard you killed your adoptive parents, who were Wajyaku merchants, with poison.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:55.030
Simply because they wanted citizenship from the Queen's quarter, they pretended to be our blood kin.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:00.240
Not only that, they even took away my little sister's life, who lived so purely.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:05.660
Those greedy Wajyaku should disappear from this world.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:11.870
And so a poison should quell poison, is that it?

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:16.910
This world is for those who live purely, is it not?

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.320
You're exactly right.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:28.250
Would you like to come along with me to restore this world to how it's supposed to be?

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:53.530
<i>We must let the Grand Duke and other Wajyaku know that we have power equivalent to that of a god, right?</i>

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:34.690
<i>Why are you carrying a dagger like that?</i>

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:41.670
<i>You're not planning to die, are y-</i>

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:44.130
<i>If a catastrophe is to befall us because of my actions,</i>

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.390
<i>then I will take responsibility before that happens.</i>

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:59.300
Bird in a Cage

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:49.030
If Touda masters...  If the Grand Duke becomes the King of this country, the skills to control the beast-lords will be sealed away.

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:37.070
Kyle.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:41.040
The Queen apparently accepted Damiya-sama's marriage proposal.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:42.530
What?

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.820
So you didn't know, either.

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:48.280
I learned from someone else, too.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:52.510
Also, we've been released from duty at her side.

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:59.230
He got rid of all the current Sezans and placed a whole new team of Sezans on duty, all of whom are under his influence.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:02.710
It's as if he had been preparing for this day.

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:06.960
How goes the investigation?

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:09.650
Oh, right.  I found something conclusive.

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:14.600
The Touda from the Grand Duke's quarter all come with a crest.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.510
The Touda that assaulted the ship that day didn't belong to the Grand Duke.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:29.870
The eggs were collected from smugglers and an army of Touda had been created in secret.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:35.010
The Saigamul were taunted, deepening the fracture between the Grand Duke and the Queen.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:41.100
If you track those behind the scheme, it all leads to one person.

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:50.930
Oh my.  What a beautiful wedding dress!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:55.220
We'll get to see Seimiya-sama in this when the mourning period ends, won't we?

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.640
Seimiya-sama?

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:00.770
Are you not feeling well?

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.780
I'm fine, Nami.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:08.310
I must go to the Forest of Cleansing two days from now.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.530
I'll be punished by the gods if I'm not focused.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:16.680
Ah.  But the gods will certainly protect you, Seimiya-sama.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:17.470
You're right.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:31.950
They're sugar candies in the shape of roses.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:35.950
The sweetness should be just perfect if you allow them to float over your tea.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:44.080
Damiya-sama, has Erin accepted your order?

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:52.300
On the day of the new dynasty, a beast-lord shall fly in the sky to prove the Queen's power.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:01.820
But...  Will the Grand Duke bend his knee on account of only one beast-lord?

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:05.070
You don't seem to see what's important.

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:13.900
The Grand Duke and the men of his army are not used to seeing Erin manipulate beast-lords.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:24.080
They will see that monstrous beast who should never befriend a human fly with one on its back for the first time in their lives.

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:32.000
Plus, they will see their invincible Touda being killed right before their eyes.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:37.100
Can't you imagine what that scene will be like?

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:46.710
In the Grand Duke's army, there will be many who will have doubts and fears

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.950
about pointing their weapons against one who they've always worshipped as a god.

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:56.970
The Grand Duke will learn the hard way that we have power equivalent to that of a god.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:08.580
Shunan swore that he would force the army to retreat if the miracle occurs.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:13.880
When he returns to his quarter, I will wed Seimiya,

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:18.840
and forge an army of beast-lords in secret.

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:24.560
I can hardly imagine Erin agreeing to that idea.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:30.600
You don't have to worry.  She's a very wise and kind girl.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:39.030
There is only one person who would become an obstruction on this path.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:44.770
He seems to investigate our actions constantly.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.640
All potential threats must be disposed of.

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:56.200
For that reason, poison is necessary at this time.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:01.510
You understand what I mean right, Kiriku?

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:13.190
<i>What do you think?  It's a rare bird that only lives in the neighboring country.</i>

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:15.000
<i>Wow, it's pretty.</i>

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.710
<i>Don't you think so, Onii-sama?</i>

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:17.610
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.940
<i>Thank you very much, Motto-san.</i>

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:24.520
<i>It's nothing.  Your father was a wonderful, noble man.</i>

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:31.690
<i>He never discriminated between Wajyaku and Holon, and he helped me start a business in the Queen's quarter.</i>

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:38.420
<i>Accepting you two as part of my family is the best expression of gratitude I could possibly give.</i>

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:43.370
<i>I only need one to receive the title of nobility.</i>

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.980
<i>There's no need to raise two of them.</i>

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:50.020
<i>Holon are nothing more than tools for the citizens of the Grand Duke's quarter.</i>

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:52.980
<i>Onii-sama...  Please live on!</i>

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:55.940
<i>Please... find happiness!</i>

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:00.560
<i>Tahya, Tahya!</i>

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:16.670
<i>Be a free bird.</i>

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:19.670
<i>Please, fly.</i>

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:22.100
<i>For Tahya's sake...</i>

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:24.970
<i>Please...</i>

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:32.770
This world should exist only for those who are pure.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:41.350
If it's for that purpose, I will become the poison to eliminate all impurities.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.310
I heard you summoned me.

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:55.540
Enter.

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.390
It's a seven-year-old vintage from the coastal region.

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:07.220
Can you smell this fresh, yet deep fragrance?

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:10.260
The slight sparkle adds its own taste, too.

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:13.460
Some say alcohol melts the heart.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.630
You should relax and savor this flavor.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.920
Will you not join me even for a glass?

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:33.870
It's for celebration's sake.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:41.350
You see, this afternoon, the Queen accepted my proposal.

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:46.550
As soon as the mourning for Harumiya-sama ends, we should be holding the wedding.

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:52.680
Congratulations upon your engagement.

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:53.820
Thank you.

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:57.690
I'm relieved, too.  This country is now secure.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:04.630
To the future of the Holy Kingdom of Ryoza.

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:15.570
Just so you know, I didn't take this step into marriage only for my sake.

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:23.070
By Seimiya and I coming together, the blood of the gods will deepen and strengthen this country.

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:28.510
The Queen, who is God to this country, will govern in her pure state.

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:33.500
The Grand Duke will sacrifice his body to accept the war and all other taints.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:39.760
That's why this country has continued in prosperity for 300 long years.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:50.220
To protect this country's way of life, all the current impurities must be corrected.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.980
Is that what you're using Erin for?

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.540
The Akun Me Chai, was it?

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:02.240
She's a strange girl.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:09.470
She's the one person in this world who can control the beast-lords and yet she resists to show her skills.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:15.410
What I wanted to ask you about is the late Queen, Harumiya-sama.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:19.880
What did that girl tell Harumiya-sama?

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:34.970
I have nothing to share.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:38.540
If necessary, Erin should tell you the tale herself.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.500
I am asking <i>you</i>.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:46.170
If I speak, would you decide against using the beast-lords?

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:48.750
That's rubbish.

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.910
That's an already-decided matter.

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:55.910
Then what power would my words hold?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:15:01.890
No matter what I say, you would keep walking the path you believe, would you not?

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:09.110
I suppose.  You're exactly right, Ial the Speed Runner.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:18.600
You seem to be omnipotent with your sharp eyes, but you're nothing more than a layer of shielding.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:27.220
Do you know that only those who are special like myself can really influence a country?

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:32.820
Also, those with true power never step outside.

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:50.230
Nobody notices, but everything moves as I wish.

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:54.280
This is...

00:15:54.570 --> 00:16:02.650
Even Seimiya and the Grand Duke's son, Shunan, are grateful tools to me.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:08.130
On top of those, even the late lady of the house.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:25.060
So that assault was conducted by you after all.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:33.780
I told you that only those who are special like myself can really influence a country, did I not?

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:38.110
Still, everything is in the darkness

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:41.450
and soon a new era will begin.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:45.750
It's about time I be rid of old tools who know the truth...

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:51.710
before the talking shield should say anything to its bearer.

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.670
You don't mean... Kyle and the others...

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:17.360
Kiriku.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.500
He's a Sezan after all.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:34.550
It frightened me how it wasn't taking effect for a while.

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.370
They are trained, after all.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:44.540
Any stronger than that, and you would have been dead, even though we had the antidote.

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.360
Take care of the rest.

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:49.560
As you say.

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:52.340
Kyle.

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:15.960
Ial.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.820
It's as you see.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:21.720
I'll attract the pursuers.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.540
You have to live on no matter what.

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:20.180
You're-!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.400
A teacher from Kazalm.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:28.310
I wouldn't have guessed that one of Damiya's spies made it even into Kazalm.

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:34.310
So Erin was being betrayed by her fellow teacher.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.880
I-I'm...

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.360
Did you drag her into this?

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:48.600
She was only living purely, the best she could, with the beast-lords.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:06.530
Even Tahya who was living purely...

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:20.590
I only wanted to see how far she would go.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:28.540
I wanted to see her fly far with the beast-lords.

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:36.390
You're the one who made her unable to fly!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:42.400
You trapped her in the cage that Damiya prepared.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:51.530
<i>I was ready for this to come any day now.</i>

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:04.250
Tahya.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:05.760
Tahya?

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:11.220
You must be a tool in Damiya's hand, too.

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:17.510
<i>Holon are nothing more than tools for the citizens of the Grand Duke's quarter.</i>

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:09.200
Having been poisoned by Damiya and being pursued, I'm no longer the Sezan Ial the Speed Runner.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:12.260
I'm just a poor fugitive.

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:18.620
As my mind fades away, the tune of
Bird of Dawn comes to my ears.

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:21.920
Erin, are you there?

00:24:21.920 --> 00:24:25.050
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Their Bond.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:26:00.070
Their Bond
